<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="git-addon-git-staging-view">
  <title>Git Staging View</title>
  <shortdesc>The controls in the <ph keyref="plugin-git-client"/> Git Staging view, region by
    region.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Staging view</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <refbody>
    <section id="section_overview">
      <title>Overview</title>
      <p>Open the <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-view"/>
        view from <menucascade><uicontrol>Window</uicontrol><uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol><uicontrol>Git
            Staging</uicontrol></menucascade>, from
        <menucascade><uicontrol>Tools</uicontrol><uicontrol>Git Client</uicontrol></menucascade>, or
        from the <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-git"/>
        menu.</p>
      <p>
        <fig>
          <title>Git Staging View</title>
          <image href="img/staging/staging_view.png" placement="inline"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_toolbar">
      <title>Toolbar</title>
      <simpletable relcolwidth="1* 2*" frame="all">
        <sthead>
          <stentry>Control</stentry>
          <stentry>Description</stentry>
        </sthead>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-push"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Sends your local commits to the remote.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-pull"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Brings remote commits into your branch. In the Vertical Ellipsis menu, the pull
            actions are grouped under a Pull submenu, as in the Git menu.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-stash"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Stashes changes or lists existing stashes.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-open-history"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Opens the Git History view for the current repository.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-open-branch-manager"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Opens the Git Branch Manager view.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow id="section_ellipsis_menu">
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ellipsis"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Opens a menu with repository setup, synchronization, ignore, configuration, and
            credential actions.</stentry>
        </strow>
      </simpletable>
    </section>
    <section id="section_header">
      <title>Header</title>
      <simpletable relcolwidth="1* 2*" frame="all">
        <sthead>
          <stentry>Control</stentry>
          <stentry>Description</stentry>
        </sthead>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-working-copy"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Selects the active working copy, or browses for one on disk.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-branch"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Shows the current branch and switches to another local branch.</stentry>
        </strow>
      </simpletable>
    </section>
    <section id="section_file_areas">
      <title>File Areas and Stage Controls</title>
      <p>The <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-unstaged-files"/>
        area lists changed files; the
        <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-staged-files"/>
        area lists files ready to commit. The controls between them move files back and forth:
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-stage-selected"/>,
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-stage-all"/>,
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-unstage-selected"/>,
        and
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-unstage-all"/>.
        Right-click a file for actions such as compare, open, stage, discard, resolve conflict, show
        history, show blame, and show in the system file manager. Use
          <uicontrol>Switch to tree/list view</uicontrol> to toggle between a flat list and a folder
        tree.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_commit_area">
      <title>Commit Area</title>
      <p>Enter a message in the
        <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-commit-message"/>
        area and select
        <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-commit"/>. The
        message toolbar adds
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-generate-ai"/>,
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-previous-comment"/>,
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-amend"/>, and
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-auto-push"/>.</p>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
